<title>HONG KONG: Citra Marga unit sets US$125 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Citra Marga unit sets US$125 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Peregrine Fixed Income.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITRA MARGA FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CITRA MARGA NUSAPHALA PERSADA</p>
<p> AMT   $125 MLN	SPREAD    130-135    MATURITY    20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE  BOND	    COUPON     **	  PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY NA	 ISS PRICE  **	  LAUNCH DATE 12.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   NA	 REOFFER    **	  FULL FEES   NA</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	DENOMS (K)  --</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS STANDARD 144A</p>
<p> MGT/UND    NA	 SELL CONC  NA	   PAY FREQ    SEMI</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  INDONESIA</p>
<p> NOTES - ** TO BE FIXED AT 1000-1100 HONG KONG TIME ON FEB 13 **</p>
<p> -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
